# The committed CI fixture lake's parquet partition (tests/fixtures/lake/)
# is scanned byte-for-byte by tools/check_no_manifest_rewrite.py --full
# (sha256 comparison against the committed manifest's recorded value, see
# generate_manifest_fixture.py's docstring). `binary` disables git's
# text/eol conversion entirely for these files so a clone/checkout can
# never silently mutate the bytes the committed sha256 covers.
*.parquet binary
